{"version":1,"content":"<p>「無綫咪神」鄧凱文於昨晚無綫年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》中，以一襲淺色閃亮超低胸吊帶晚裝驚艷全場，大晒傲人上圍，相當吸睛！</p><p>不過事後有網民覺得其戰衣不太稱身，上圍被夾得相當辛苦，更有網民直指她「岩石胸」疑似造假。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T13:24:02.171656+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T12:32:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:18.840025+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:18.840025+00:00","content_hash":"83a0679d3b61f8426e5f6ad25607e246450fd617d7077a9b8a89edb84d383576","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}